{"word":"histological","translation":"histológico","definition_en":"Pertaining to the microscopic study of the structure of biological tissues.","definition_pt":"Permitindo o estudo microscópico da estrutura dos tecidos biológicos.","example_en":"The histological analysis revealed abnormal cell growth.","example_pt":"A análise histológica revelou crescimento anormal das células.","cefr_level":"C1","word_type":"adjective","category_slug":"health","frequency_rank":null},
